{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13220630","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220630","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322063001:0":{"text":"これが木馬の材料か。見たことない木材だが、確かに頑丈そうだ……","source_cn":"这些是做木马的材料吗？这种木料我不认识，但的确很结实……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA506F665F1F7D50A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322063002:0":{"text":"これは何の植物だね？","source_cn":"这又是什么植物？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x833C7AB235361755","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322063003:1":{"text":"テイルアロエですよ。茎を折ると、中からゲル状の液体が流れ出るのですが、それが粘着剤にピッタリなんです。部品をくっつけるのに便利ですよ。","source_cn":"是蓬尾芦，这种植物茎秆折断后会流出胶状的液体，是很好的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71E01412CB7DB278","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322063004:1":{"text":"ほう、これらの材料で作れるのか。本当に助かったよ、私は人体以外には疎くてね……","source_cn":"喔，这些就够了？多亏了你们，我对人体之外的东西研究有限……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D5B7C16CE1F14FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322063005:1":{"text":"あなた、前みたいに木馬に本物の動物の心臓を飾らないの？眼球を集めて塗料も作りたいわ……","source_cn":"亲爱的，不用再给木马装上一颗真正的动物心脏了吗？我还想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA5B6F7D9C844D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1322063005":{"text":"あなた、前みたいに木馬に本物の動物の心臓を飾らないの？眼球を集めて塗料も作りたいわ……","source_cn":"亲爱的，不用再给木马装上一颗真正的动物心脏了吗？我还想去收集一些眼珠做涂料……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA5B6F7D9C844D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322063006:1":{"text":"親切な客人が材料を揃えてくれて助かった。早速木馬を作ろう。メスを握るのには慣れているが、無機物を組み立てるのはどうかねえ……","source_cn":"多亏这些好心的客人，材料有了，还是赶快做木马吧。我的手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x271F0638512FB92F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322063007:1":{"text":"朝になる前には完成させたいねえ。ダイモンが起きたら、きっと驚くだろう……","source_cn":"赶在天亮前做好，等戴蒙睡醒，正好可以给他一个小惊喜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CB08CA7E2C14032","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:12:1322064001:":{"text":"こうやって組み立てるのかい？","source_cn":"是这样组装吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7B764C39995E39C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:12:1322064002:":{"text":"なぜ動かないのかしら？","source_cn":"怎么不动呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1A002F021391AEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docume